    "attribution": {},
    "description": "<p>Requires Systems Operator position.</p><p>Make a <strong>Finesse Action Roll</strong> against a target’s difficulty to use the vehicle’s systems to apply the <em>Lock On</em> condition.</p><p>Whenever a character makes an <strong>Action Roll</strong> against a target that has <em>Lock On</em>, they may burn the Lock On to gain a <strong>d6</strong> to their attack <strong>and</strong> damage roll. This removes the <em>Lock On</em> from the target.</p>",
